---
import { ATELIER_HOME, ATELIER_LINKS, SHOP } from '../data/seoSite';
---
<footer id="footer-contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="logo">Pantaloni cu Snur Lung<span>.ro</span></div>
        <p>Site informativ in romana despre pantaloni cu snur lung, tinute moda urbana, ghiduri de alegere si trenduri 2026. Pentru produse, stoc si comenzi, traficul merge transparent catre <a href={ATELIER_HOME} target="_blank" rel="noopener">AtelierAXD.ro</a>.</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/atelieraxd.ro/" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
          <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@atelieraxd" aria-label="TikTok" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok"></i></a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@atelieraxd" aria-label="YouTube" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100067635362487" aria-label="Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col"><h4>Ghiduri</h4><ul><li><a href="/ghid-alegere-pantaloni-snur-lung/">Ghid alegere</a></li><li><a href="/blog/pantaloni-snur-lung-outfit-idei/">Tinute cu snur lung</a></li><li><a href="/blog/trenduri-urbane-pantaloni-2026/">Trenduri moda urbana 2026</a></li><li><a href="/blog/cum-faci-nod-snur-pantaloni/">Cum legi snurul</a></li><li><a href="/pantaloni-cu-snur-lung-unisex/">Ghid unisex</a></li><li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li></ul></div>
      <div class="footer-col"><h4>Site</h4><ul><li><a href="/despre-noi/">Despre noi</a></li><li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li><li><a href="/faq/">Intrebari frecvente</a></li><li><a href="/politica-de-confidentialitate/">Politica de confidentialitate</a></li><li><a href="/termeni-si-conditii/">Termeni si conditii</a></li><li><button class="cookie-reset" type="button" data-cookie-reset>Retrage consimtamantul</button></li></ul></div>
      <div class="footer-col"><h4>Atelier AXD</h4><ul><li><a href={SHOP} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pantaloni barbati</a></li><li><a href={ATELIER_LINKS.tricouri} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tricouri barbati</a></li><li><a href={ATELIER_LINKS.hanorace} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hanorace barbati</a></li><li><a href={ATELIER_LINKS.seturi} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Seturi barbati</a></li><li><a href={ATELIER_LINKS.reduceri} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reduceri</a></li><li><a href={ATELIER_LINKS.blog} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Blog Atelier AXD</a></li></ul></div>
    </div>
    <div class="delivery-payment-box">
      <div class="dp-group">
        <span class="dp-title">Livrare si plata</span>
        <div class="dp-flex">
          <span class="dp-badge">Sameday Courier</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Easybox Delivery</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Plata ramburs</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Card</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Cash</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Visa</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Apple Pay</span>
          <span class="dp-badge">Google Pay</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="anpc-logos" aria-label="Informatii ANPC">
        <a href="/informatii-legale/" aria-label="Informatii legale ANPC"><img src="/ANPC_logo.avif" alt="ANPC" width="120" height="35" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
        <a href="/solutionarea-litigiilor/" aria-label="Solutionarea alternativa a litigiilor"><img src="/Solutionarea_online_a_litigiilor_logo.avif" alt="Solutionarea alternativa a litigiilor" width="120" height="35" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-notice">
      <strong>SC ATELIER AXD SRL</strong> | CUI: 50848938 | Reg. Com: J2024039294009 | Str. Mare A Unirii 4, Bl. 5, Sc. 2, Et. 1, Ap. 17, Focsani, Vrancea | atelieraxd@outlook.com
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom"><p>&copy; 2026 pantalonicusnurlung.ro | Site informativ operat de SC ATELIER AXD SRL.</p></div>
  </div>
</footer>
